{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#feature-script","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的功能「运行脚本并导出 STEP」：工具运行版本 1 的 noBS CAD 脚本，导出模型并返回特征摘要、孔位和警告。由模型调用工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:255-270"]}
{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#feature-inspect","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的功能「检查 STEP 模型」：模型调用工具重新导入 STEP，读取包围盒、面数量和竖直孔位，用于复核导出的零件。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:272-286"]}
{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#feature-check","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的功能「核对特征表与模型」：模型提供预期包围盒和孔特征后，工具比较其与 STEP 中的结果，列出匹配、缺失或多出的孔及偏差。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:288-304"]}
{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#feature-overlay","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的功能「把模型孔位叠加到图纸」：用户提供图纸、STEP 文件和板件尺寸后，工具输出标注孔位的 PNG；可指定毫米区域生成高分辨率局部图。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:306-332"]}
{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#feature-probe","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的功能「读取和检查工程图」：工具可渲染 PDF、PNG、JPG，校准板件轮廓、裁切局部，并将模型孔与图纸符号进行评分或匹配。 通过对应的 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:334-377"]}
{"unit_id":"jackControls__dsh-noBS-CAD-step#caveat-engine","repo":"jackControls/dsh-noBS-CAD-step","commit":"0581cfc2e0b28520d5903a6de004399fa77b839b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-noBS-CAD-step 的 CAD 建模与检查依赖本机 noBS CAD 引擎，须配置或能自动发现该引擎；配置入口包括 server 或 NBCAD_MCP。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-49","lib/host-utils.js:156-180"]}
